  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.0.3:\n\n## Fixed\n- Improved performance of `GcPdfDocument.GetText()` when `RecognitionAlgorithm` is set to `RecognitionAlgorithm.AcrobatLike` on the document. (DOC-7441)\n- Fixed a `NullReferenceException` when loading certain PDFs using `GcPdfDocument.Load()`. (DOC-7459)",
